# Due Diligence has "enchant creature", so it may enchant Bot2's Ornithopter, which gets +2/+2 and vigilance while the Aura stays. "Target creature you control
# other than enchanted creature" is then Bot1's own Ornithopter, pumped until end of turn. And on a second Aura cast on Bot1's only creature, no creature of Bot1's is
# a legal target, so the trigger leaves no effect and the enchanted Ornithopter is 2/4 for good with nothing else changed.

